The 10:55Z revert answered box 50631, where the owner's named person was
refused. That refusal came from the full-wave cap, not from the order gate,
and its cause — the „also" particle hiding the name — is fixed in the patch
before this one. The order gate itself was right; its tests come back.
SEE_HELPER_ON (BE) stays off until its own Excel fault (50656) is fixed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
